// Copy to Config/Local.xcconfig (git-ignored) to override signing on your machine.
//
// Build without an Apple Developer team: ad-hoc signing with the reduced entitlements (sandbox, user-selected files,
// network). iCloud sync and Sign in with Apple are then off and the app explains that at runtime.
// (Also clear DEVELOPMENT_TEAM in Xcode ▸ Worklog target ▸ Signing & Capabilities, or set your own team there.)

WORKLOG_TEAM =
WORKLOG_SIGN_IDENTITY = -
WORKLOG_ENTITLEMENTS = Worklog/Resources/WorklogLocal.entitlements
